{"id":"n15416-1-8","stage":2,"title":"물가 · 物价","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15416-1-8-1","ko":"요즘 물가가 너무 많이 오른 것 같아요.","zh":"最近物价好像涨得太厉害了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"물가가","meaning":"物价","explanation":"물가：物价；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물가","audio":"/audio/f4d16c8379abbc0f64e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15416","senseId":"1","lemma":"물가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물가가","audio":"/audio/0427690cba4bc45f8848.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"오른","meaning":"上升，上涨","explanation":"오르다：上升，上涨；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"오르다","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69518","senseId":"10","lemma":"오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오른","audio":"/audio/1766ca81c27c1ea5beae.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"这件事、这种情况（名词化）","explanation":"오른 것 把已经涨价的情况名词化；-ㄴ 것 같다 表示对该情况的判断、推测，不限定为尚未发生的未来事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아요","audio":"/audio/d27f58354e12c6dc5616.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"f4d16c8379abbc0f","term":"물가","zh":"物价","audio":"/audio/f4d16c8379abbc0f64e9.mp3","entryId":"15416","definition":"东西或服务的平均价格。","pronunciation":["물까"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"8fdeb9822b3fa061","term":"오르다","zh":"上升，上涨","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3","entryId":"69518","definition":"价格、数值、温度、成绩等比以前多或高。","pronunciation":["오르다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"这件事、这种情况（名词化）","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"这件事、这种情况（名词化）","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/dd21199092a49eda1461.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15416-1-8-2","ko":"네, 맞아요. 요새는 시장도 잘 못 보겠어요.","zh":"是啊，没错。现在连去市场买东西都很困难了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"맞아요.","meaning":"正确，对","explanation":"맞다：正确，对；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"1","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아요","audio":"/audio/bcc473b26491895baa49.mp3"}},{"text":"요새는","meaning":"近来，日来，最近","explanation":"요새：近来，日来，最近；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요새","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67864","senseId":"1","lemma":"요새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요새는","audio":"/audio/bdbdb91b6843e6c1a63c.mp3"}},{"text":"시장도","meaning":"市场","explanation":"시장：市场；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"시장","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17193","senseId":"2","lemma":"시장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시장도","audio":"/audio/81cfb7556fe449da7dba.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"보겠어요.","meaning":"买货","explanation":"보다：买货；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"11","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보겠어요","audio":"/audio/560cbd9f48e359ca7095.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd0